  "title": "Old-Fashioned Chocolate Fudge",
  "description": "This chocolate fudge recipe uses just 5 ingredients to make these rich, creamy, and delicious chocolaty fudge treats perfect for the holidays or any occasion!",
  "authors": [
    "BOOK_WORM"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-04-11T23:24:45-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2026-02-17T21:29:32-05:00",
  "prep_time": "PT20M",
  "cook_time": "PT15M",
  "total_time": "PT85M",
  "yield": [
    "64",
    "64 (1-inch) squares"
  ],
  "categories": [
    "Dessert"
  ],
  "cuisines": [
    "American"
  ],
  "regions": [
    "American"
  ],
  "breadcrumbs": [],
  "keywords": [
    "publisher-tested"
  ],
  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups white sugar",
    "0.5 cup unsweetened cocoa powder",
    "1 cup whole milk",
    "4 tablespoons unsalted butter, sliced and softened",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/W7KdcNbbLpsGGN3zZnNpmbSQ29o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9420-old-fashioned-chocolate-fudge-DDMFS-step-01-0273-488c01d6b1d04d1cbc74a19017b1637b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9420/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grease an 8-inch square baking pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5VYow8hS4jmxZRQ1gSY3tS_WpMs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9420-old-fashioned-chocolate-fudge-DDMFS-step-02-0274-96fcc6c4bef74aa6a13058b51cedeb86.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9420/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place sugar and cocoa powder in a medium saucepan; stir in milk until blended. Heat over medium-high, stirring constantly, until mixture comes to a boil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/71yWecT5MVQB_uA35hHv6iaOa3w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9420-old-fashioned-chocolate-fudge-DDMFS-step-03-0281-a51aaad04a934a878fb5b95df5277882.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9420/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reduce heat to low; attach a candy thermometer to the pan. Simmer, without stirring, until mixture reaches 238 degrees F (114 degrees C), about 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WyY5L-vbwlOLGy8_vqhlPP4b2Xg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9420-old-fashioned-chocolate-fudge-DDMFS-step-04-0287-0cf06646ee5b40c690b765fc4835a3ec.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9420/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "If you don't have a candy thermometer, drop a small amount of the mixture into cold water; if it forms a soft ball that flattens when removed from the water and placed on a flat surface, it's ready.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/C-QZUn-a9081zuWyl6EeIR3wCnM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9420-old-fashioned-chocolate-fudge-DDMFS-step-05-B-0296-eaaa56fdc3414eefb8cb5c272696d4ba.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9420/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from the heat; set aside to cool to 110 degrees F (43 degrees C), 50 to 70 minutes. Do not disturb fudge as it's cooling.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/D6WXbfMTrEHki0E7AvaZR9MpUcs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9420-old-fashioned-chocolate-fudge-DDMFS-step-06-0262-e0bfc5c903c34793843b39010d78a47d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9420/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add butter and vanilla to the cooled fudge. Beat with a wooden spoon until well incorporated and fudge loses its sheen; do not under beat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3jvCOkt_2NuZpA5IDZknBsEZcls=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9420-old-fashioned-chocolate-fudge-DDMFS-step-07-0363-f03dad1838204b03af6e3eb9ac5242f4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9420/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour fudge into the prepared pan; press to flatten. Cool completely at room temperature or in the refrigerator before cutting into 1-inch squares.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/kq6ljlNpBrzIRU-7EIMJYugzf1M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9420-old-fashioned-chocolate-fudge-DDMFS-step-08-0459-70d7822881854ad7bf8d99e45a5b1105.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9420/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/24lenlO-T6UxXbBeeJHi5f66erY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9420-old-fashioned-chocolate-fudge-DDMFS-hero-4x3-0529-a9e35a1759a74c0e99ac522fe3c58251.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9420/step_09.webp"
    }
  ],
